Giancarlo Santucci is a human and an operative of the [[Org/Actinium Convox/index|Actinium Convox]]. He is broad-built, with dark hair combed back, and wears expensive, near-designer clothes. He is a follower of the [[Iridescent Host|Host]] and gives its praise freely.

He has three brothers, Gianluca, Gianfranco, and Gianmarco, and mentions them often.
